.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH voa 1  "voa 0.7.5" 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
voa \- Command line interface for interacting with VOA hierarchies
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBvoa\fR [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR]... [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Command line interface for interacting with VOA hierarchies
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Increase logging verbosity
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Decrease logging verbosity
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
voa\-config(1)
Interact with the VOA configuration for technology backends.
.TP
voa\-import(1)
Import a single verifier into a VOA hierarchy.
.TP
voa\-list(1)
List all verifiers in VOA that match provided identifiers.
.TP
voa\-verify(1)
Verify a file using suitable verifiers and signatures.
.TP
voa\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
v0.7.5
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
Arne Beer <contact@arne.beer>, David Runge <dvzrv@archlinux.org>, Heiko Schaefer <heiko@schaefer.name>, Orhun Parmaksız <orhun@archlinux.org>
